NativeTavern QNN Upscale
========================

This plugin adapts the Snapdragon / QNN anime upscale approach used by Local Dream
(https://github.com/xororz/local-dream), which is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0).

If you ship Local Dream's native upscaler executable (`libstable_diffusion_core.so`)
or its QNN runtime libraries under `jniLibs/` / `assets/qnnlibs/`, those components
remain subject to Local Dream's CC BY-NC 4.0 terms. Do not redistribute them for
commercial use without obtaining rights from the original authors.

Anime upscaler weights are downloaded at runtime from Hugging Face
(`xororz/upscaler`, Real-ESRGAN anime 6B QNN bins). Upstream model licenses apply.
